msgid "The first enabled tariff matching the selected day and time is used. Click the day buttons to include or exclude Monday through Sunday. Equal From and To times define a full-day tariff. Applied import and feed-in prices and the currency are stored in every history interval, so later changes do not rewrite or relabel past costs. An interval crossing a tariff boundary uses time-weighted prices for its respective tariff segments. Overview monetary totals include only records in the currently selected currency because the plug-in does not perform currency conversion."
